     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/brokenbrow-2021-01-22"
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Niko reaches its docks through an Omenpath, enters its warm hall and senses it is home, then joins the feasting dead.",
    "cites": [
     "know-which-way-wind-blowing-2021-01-08-e13",
     "aim-through-target-2021-01-15-e0",
     "aim-through-target-2021-01-15-e1"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/know-which-way-wind-blowing-2021-01-08#:~:text=The%20skiff%20bumped%20against,that%20sings%20of%20home.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/aim-through-target-2021-01-15#:~:text=Starnheim%20was%20home.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/aim-through-target-2021-01-15#:~:text=Niko%20Aris%2C%20they%20of%20Meletis%2C"
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Niko warns the Valkyries that the Cosmos Serpent is coming, but they refuse to believe Starnheim can be attacked.",
    "cites": [
     "aim-through-target-2021-01-15-e3"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/aim-through-target-2021-01-15#:~:text=the%20Cosmos%20Serpent%20is%20coming%20for%20you."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Koma then tears into the sky above Starnheim and the Valkyries panic, though Tibalt's use of the Sword of the Realms to cut open a doorway and unleash Koma on the Valkyries is told on another page.",
    "cites": [
     "aim-through-target-2021-01-15-e5",
     "episode-3-saga-tibalt-2021-01-20-e7"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/aim-through-target-2021-01-15#:~:text=The%20creature%20solidified%20into,of%20the%20Cosmos%20itself.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-3-saga-tibalt-2021-01-20#:~:text=he%20cut%20open%20a,up%20for%20lost%20time"
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Niko devises a plan to lure Koma back out through an Omenpath, and Koma crashes through the hole and falls out of Starnheim.",
    "cites": [
     "aim-through-target-2021-01-15-e6",
     "aim-through-target-2021-01-15-e10"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/aim-through-target-2021-01-15#:~:text=Fly%20in%20close%2C%20right,way%20cats%20chase%20toys.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/aim-through-target-2021-01-15#:~:text=Koma%27s%20weight%20and%20momentum,down%20through%20the%20hole"
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "In Brokenbrow, Njala seeks out the skald Hormgart in Starnheim, who begins the tale of how Arni got his new name.",
    "cites": [
     "brokenbrow-2021-01-22-e6",
     "brokenbrow-2021-01-22-e7"
    ],
    "links": [
